@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - System Administrator Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor "System Administrator" as SysAdmin

rectangle "HANBAY HOTEL - SYSTEM ADMINISTRATION" {
    usecase "Login" as UC_Login

    package "User Account Management" {
        usecase "Manage User Accounts" as UC_ManageUsers
        usecase "Create Staff Account" as UC_CreateStaff
        usecase "Update Account Information" as UC_UpdateAccount
        usecase "Activate or Deactivate Account" as UC_AccountStatus
        usecase "Reset User Password" as UC_ResetPassword
    }

    package "Authorization Management" {
        usecase "Manage Roles and Permissions" as UC_ManageRoles
        usecase "Assign Role to User" as UC_AssignRole
        usecase "Revoke Role from User" as UC_RevokeRole
    }

    package "System Operations" {
        usecase "Manage System Configuration" as UC_Config
        usecase "View Audit Logs" as UC_AuditLogs
        usecase "View System Health" as UC_Health
    }
}

SysAdmin --> UC_Login
SysAdmin --> UC_ManageUsers
SysAdmin --> UC_ManageRoles
SysAdmin --> UC_Config
SysAdmin --> UC_AuditLogs
SysAdmin --> UC_Health

UC_ManageUsers ..> UC_CreateStaff : <<include>>
UC_ManageUsers ..> UC_UpdateAccount : <<include>>
UC_ManageUsers ..> UC_AccountStatus : <<include>>
UC_ResetPassword ..> UC_ManageUsers : <<extend>>
UC_ManageRoles ..> UC_AssignRole : <<include>>
UC_ManageRoles ..> UC_RevokeRole : <<include>>

note bottom of UC_ManageRoles
System Administrator manages technical access.
Manager manages hotel operations and business data.
end note

@enduml
